2026-10-18T08:00:55.1207925Z 
2026-10-18T08:00:55.1208203Z The goal is a proposition, so `have` is preferred over `haveI`.
2026-10-18T08:00:55.1211722Z The difference between `have` and `haveI` is that `haveI` inlines the value.
2026-10-18T08:00:55.1214485Z But this is not relevant for proofs because of proof irrelevance.
